  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation to Combat Illegal Logging and Improve Forest Governance in Panama</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this program is to reduce illegal logging, improve forest management and forest governance, and to help ensure the inclusion of indigenous communities and women in the management of natural resources in Panama.</narrative>
